dtq9p-LxRIpPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAYok-t1IQruFbTzfhknMsPe2xg5rMeGvyCx0U2lH7bGQ&oe=6A4CFBA2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-image.png", "id": "754920860513597", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618453_754920863846930_2000131279644586562_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZfdSXQFpS5UQ7kNvwGunLRy&_nc_oc=AdowlTJP6q2URxVxfaeEUXy3KprbYUpukQFY3xvn_9xYt2BhPiDQo4-wQ_FwNLB0kXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAea95t-okpqXGPz_97RkPKRwgKHABsJMvMr9Q5awmIFw&oe=6A4D0790"}, "display_name": "StickBot", "keywords": [], "long_description": "StickBot records, playbacks, and mirrors your live actions. \nThere are four pre-loads varying from \n> dance \n> tai chi\n> exercise\nYou can record your own or just go live  \n\nEach recording lasts 30 seconds\n\nThere's also a camera view in the menu on your left hand palm, \nproviding a live third-person preview.\n\nOpen your left hand to use the menu\nClose your hands when moving around to disable the menu\n\nConcepts and Tools explored:\n> Unity, Meta XR, Hand Tracking, \n> Passthrough, \n> Procedural Meshes,\n> Binary Save and Load \n> Full Body Tracking\n> Morphing Poses\n\nDeveloped on a Quest 2 and a Mac book Pro in around 2 months\nFloor color shows FPS:\n72:green\n70-71:light-green\n65-69:yellow\n0-64:red\n\nTools used:\n> Terminal\n> Omnigraffle\n> iMovie\n> GIF brewery\n> Preview\n> QuickTime\n> Audacity\n> Garage Band\n\nIssues Encountered:\n> Button presses (accidental)\n> Latency (72 hz)", "short_description": "StickBot records, playbacks, and mirrors your live actions. \nThere are four pre-loads varying from \n> dance \n> tai chi\n> exercise\nYou can record your own or just go live  \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/13VNKNGNB0iONUUEiX-tDbj3dJ1cQDAv7T-ESRB0Dm_g/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_se